      "title": "Man, 82, dies after brawl with 76-year-old over sunlounger on Greek beach",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/greek-police-investigate-death-man-beach-brawl",
      "description": "<p>Row at Athenian riviera resort turned violent after two elderly bathers reportedly argued over shortage of loungers</p><p>Greek police are investigating the death of an 82-year-old man after a brawl over a sunlounger at a beach on the Athenian riviera.</p><p>The man had arrived at the popular bathing spot of Vouliagmeni before 10am on Sunday hoping to secure a sunbed, but he soon began arguing with a fellow bather – described by authorities as a “76-year-old man unknown to him” – when it became clear loungers were in short supply.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/greek-police-investigate-death-man-beach-brawl\">Continue reading...</a>",
